WEBVTT

01:33.800 --> 01:35.600
Many years ago,

01:35.680 --> 01:37.560
on the land of the Tiemo people,

01:38.920 --> 01:40.960
a woman from Chang'an was captured.

01:42.000 --> 01:45.160
The Tiemo believed she was a shadow guard.

01:47.160 --> 01:48.600
A shadow guard captured,

01:49.520 --> 01:51.480
and more shadow guards would come for her.

01:52.360 --> 01:55.880
Every shadow guard
carries invaluable military intelligence,

01:56.400 --> 01:57.760
immeasurable in worth.

02:07.360 --> 02:10.639
She was hung upon a turning pole,
used as bait.

02:11.200 --> 02:12.360
Under sun and rain,

02:13.280 --> 02:14.680
for seven days in full.

02:15.240 --> 02:16.640
No one came to save her.

02:17.720 --> 02:19.280
Even the Tiemo people

02:20.000 --> 02:22.160
eventually lost interest in her.

02:29.320 --> 02:31.800
Except for one patient man.

02:49.200 --> 02:50.640
On the seventh night,

02:51.280 --> 02:55.360
the soldiers guarding her abandoned her,
thinking she was dead.

02:58.080 --> 03:01.160
And that man had waited

03:01.240 --> 03:03.000
for this very moment.

03:07.680 --> 03:09.600
He loved to gamble

03:09.680 --> 03:11.320
and was skilled in disguise.

03:11.840 --> 03:13.400
He saw she was still alive

03:14.400 --> 03:17.440
and knew a woman who survived seven days

03:18.600 --> 03:20.880
could not be a common shadow guard.

03:21.760 --> 03:23.880
She might be of the Huben Army.

03:54.280 --> 03:57.520
He helped her when her will

03:57.600 --> 03:59.120
was weakest.

03:59.200 --> 04:00.920
He drew out key intelligence

04:02.160 --> 04:04.040
and once he had what he needed,

04:04.560 --> 04:08.040
he then killed her completely.

04:15.040 --> 04:18.320
That man was calm

04:19.720 --> 04:21.279
and cruel.

04:38.880 --> 04:40.520
That man,

04:42.440 --> 04:45.080
back then in Tiemo,
was known as a brilliant conspirator.

04:46.040 --> 04:49.640
The intelligence he obtained
turned the war in their favor.

04:51.000 --> 04:51.920
And so,

04:53.080 --> 04:54.720
he was awarded great military merit.

04:55.600 --> 04:56.840
After that,

04:57.920 --> 05:00.520
he rose to become the new King of Tiemo.

05:10.720 --> 05:12.040
Wu Zhongheng.

05:13.600 --> 05:15.280
I never truly knew the man.

05:17.360 --> 05:18.800
He deceived my father,

05:19.320 --> 05:21.200
and he deceived me as well.

05:26.160 --> 05:28.840
The Huben elites
who came to save her that year

05:29.600 --> 05:32.360
had already advanced deep
into the Chen Valley.

05:34.040 --> 05:36.960
I used the intel
I coaxed out of that woman,

05:38.000 --> 05:39.840
I led 100 Huben elites

05:40.360 --> 05:42.000
straight into a granary,

05:43.120 --> 05:44.640
and left them
to butcher one another inside.

05:53.120 --> 05:55.000
What I never foresaw

05:55.960 --> 05:57.480
was that one Huben elite

05:58.440 --> 06:00.800
would make it out alive,
and return to Chang'an.

06:03.080 --> 06:05.840
He later grew in power, overtook me,

06:06.440 --> 06:08.400
and killed your father, Liu Ziwen.

06:10.000 --> 06:11.920
Then he reshaped the balance in Tiemo,

06:12.560 --> 06:13.960
forcing my plans

06:14.760 --> 06:17.040
to be delayed for 15 more years.

06:19.760 --> 06:21.280
Yan Fengshan.

06:22.880 --> 06:26.800
A name one remembers
even at the brink of death.

06:39.560 --> 06:42.200
Perhaps this is simply karma.

06:43.960 --> 06:45.160
White Hair.

06:46.720 --> 06:49.160
Back then,
living under the name Wu Zhongheng,

06:49.880 --> 06:52.040
I moved among your father's generation.

06:54.440 --> 06:56.200
All those years,

06:57.280 --> 07:00.680
not once did I hear anyone
mention your mother.

07:01.920 --> 07:03.040
Where was she, I wonder?

07:16.160 --> 07:17.440
A woman

07:17.960 --> 07:20.840
for whom 100 Huben elites
would give their lives

07:22.920 --> 07:25.720
must have held a noble and rare status.

07:27.360 --> 07:28.840
What a pity.

07:29.480 --> 07:31.040
I cut her down from that pole,

07:32.440 --> 07:34.560
yet she left not a single word behind.

07:36.760 --> 07:38.520
Had she spoken even once,

07:39.320 --> 07:42.280
it might have eased the longing
of a family somewhere in Chang'an.

07:50.200 --> 07:51.920
My mother is in the north.

07:53.240 --> 07:54.720
When all this ends,

07:55.600 --> 07:57.160
she will return.

07:58.080 --> 07:59.080
Is that so?

08:03.800 --> 08:05.280
I hope you are right.

08:06.920 --> 08:08.080
Truth is,

08:09.640 --> 08:11.520
I never killed for pleasure.

08:13.160 --> 08:14.760
I killed only to reach

08:15.880 --> 08:16.920
my goal.

08:18.680 --> 08:19.800
Nothing more.

08:26.520 --> 08:28.200
The deposed emperor is in your grasp,

08:28.720 --> 08:30.640
and so are my friends.

08:34.120 --> 08:35.360
These past days,

08:36.600 --> 08:38.000
you have been waiting for me.

08:39.120 --> 08:40.240
Speak.

08:42.159 --> 08:43.280
What do you want from me?

08:51.760 --> 08:53.160
Kill Xiao Wuyang for me.

08:55.840 --> 08:57.360
Why do you not do it yourself?

08:57.440 --> 09:00.320
You endured 15 years to stay alive,

09:00.400 --> 09:02.320
playing the long game for vengeance.

09:03.360 --> 09:05.480
And I endured 25 years.

09:06.320 --> 09:10.160
Of course I will leave the greatest chance
for myself.

09:13.760 --> 09:14.760
Very well.

09:15.760 --> 09:19.240
Then tell me, why choose me?

09:19.840 --> 09:22.200
Because you plotted the death
of Yan Fengshan,

09:22.760 --> 09:25.400
which means you can do it again

09:26.400 --> 09:28.120
and bring me Xiao Wuyang's head.

09:33.200 --> 09:34.800
You truly are my mentor.

09:40.240 --> 09:41.800
I know one thing.

09:42.840 --> 09:44.800
On that throne in Chang'an,

09:45.600 --> 09:47.920
there will never be room for two.

09:49.120 --> 09:50.320
As it stands,

09:51.480 --> 09:53.120
Tiemo is at our gates.

09:53.840 --> 09:55.440
I will help you kill him.

09:56.120 --> 09:57.640
But after it is done,

09:59.480 --> 10:00.960
you will release my friends.

10:01.560 --> 10:02.720
Do not worry.

10:04.040 --> 10:05.360
I

10:05.880 --> 10:07.480
do not kill for pleasure.

10:08.520 --> 10:10.520
I kill only to achieve a goal.

10:10.600 --> 10:13.320
I took your friends
only to force your hand.

10:14.360 --> 10:15.680
I made a promise to Gu Yu.

10:16.360 --> 10:18.040
He wished to die in his homeland,

10:18.120 --> 10:19.320
and I granted him that.

10:20.280 --> 10:22.240
If you kill Xiao Wuyang for me,

10:22.880 --> 10:24.200
I will grant you the same,

10:24.720 --> 10:26.400
your friends will be safe.

11:47.280 --> 11:48.160
It's nearly done.

11:48.240 --> 11:49.080
Dinner is ready.

11:49.160 --> 11:50.240
Thank you, my dear.

11:50.320 --> 11:52.160
‎It's time for dinner.

11:52.240 --> 11:53.400
Father, Mother, let's eat.

11:53.480 --> 11:54.520
‎Grandpa.

11:54.600 --> 11:55.440
Qinghe,

11:55.520 --> 11:57.000
-sit and eat properly.
-Grandfather.

11:58.120 --> 12:00.640
-You little kid.
-Alright, Qinghe, no more fussing.

12:00.720 --> 12:01.560
Let's eat first.

12:01.640 --> 12:02.600
Here.

12:03.600 --> 12:04.600
Sit down first.

12:06.480 --> 12:07.960
Grandfather, I want meat.

12:08.040 --> 12:09.760
Meat? Meat it is, have some.

12:09.840 --> 12:10.840
Tasty.

12:12.120 --> 12:13.120
Grandmother, have some meat.

12:14.040 --> 12:15.720
-Sit down first.
-Qinghe, sit.

12:15.800 --> 12:17.160
-Sit and eat.
-Let me serve some soup for you.

12:17.240 --> 12:18.400
What a handful!

12:43.840 --> 12:45.160
I owe debts and never pay them.

12:45.240 --> 12:46.480
I'm shameless to the core.

12:47.000 --> 12:48.280
I'm shameless to the core,

12:48.360 --> 12:49.960
not even man enough to repay what I owe.

12:50.040 --> 12:50.920
I'm shameless to the core,

12:51.000 --> 12:52.520
not even man enough to repay what I owe.

12:52.600 --> 12:53.520
Truly penniless.

12:54.360 --> 12:55.200
So poor.

12:55.840 --> 12:57.000
Then why gamble?

12:57.080 --> 12:59.320
A poor man only gambles to rise again.

12:59.400 --> 13:00.520
What good are you alive?

13:07.400 --> 13:08.360
Tomorrow,

13:08.440 --> 13:10.280
go fish with Liang.

13:10.360 --> 13:11.840
He's an honest man.

13:11.920 --> 13:13.080
You'll be paid daily.

13:13.880 --> 13:15.360
Thank you, Master Lu. Thank you.

13:15.440 --> 13:17.440
Master Lu,
you're like a second father to me.

13:17.520 --> 13:19.320
-Thank you, Master Lu.
-I just worry you'll skip out,

13:19.400 --> 13:20.800
and ruin my reputation.

13:20.880 --> 13:22.880
You'll see me every day after work.

13:23.840 --> 13:25.200
I'll take half your wages

13:26.120 --> 13:27.400
until every debt is paid.

13:28.880 --> 13:30.880
If you slack off,

13:30.960 --> 13:32.600
I'll cut your flesh to settle the debt.

14:13.000 --> 14:14.560
Your Majesty. You're back.

14:15.520 --> 14:17.680
-The food is still warm.
-Good.

14:42.880 --> 14:43.720
Your Majesty.

14:44.480 --> 14:46.600
You're still badly injured.

14:46.680 --> 14:48.200
Why go out again?

14:48.280 --> 14:49.120
You…

14:49.200 --> 14:51.080
And those people, they…

14:51.160 --> 14:53.360
They failed to kill me once.

14:54.040 --> 14:55.720
They'll try again.

14:55.800 --> 14:57.560
I need to be ready.

15:02.200 --> 15:04.400
Enough. It's alright now.

15:05.040 --> 15:05.920
Let's eat.

15:06.440 --> 15:07.320
Come.

15:14.880 --> 15:16.840
Come. Sit and eat with me.

15:18.200 --> 15:19.080
I have plenty.

15:20.280 --> 15:21.680
Here, there is no emperor.

15:22.480 --> 15:25.920
Only the shopkeeper
and the one he shelters.

15:26.880 --> 15:28.240
-Sit, eat.
-Alright.

15:35.840 --> 15:37.440
Yan Fengshan is dead.

15:38.480 --> 15:42.040
Aside from that news,
is there anything good to hear?

15:44.600 --> 15:47.160
The armies surrounding the city
have withdrawn.

15:47.960 --> 15:50.240
The forces of the regional commanders

15:50.920 --> 15:53.880
are already returning
to their feudal towns.

15:54.400 --> 15:57.440
Many people went out recently,
they saw it themselves.

15:59.400 --> 16:02.440
These days, I walked along Cangshui River,

16:03.040 --> 16:06.040
heard many talking
about the troop movements.

16:07.000 --> 16:08.600
It matches what you said.

16:12.160 --> 16:14.240
Why aren't you eating? Eat.

16:28.480 --> 16:30.040
Sir.

16:30.120 --> 16:31.080
Come.

16:31.680 --> 16:33.360
Sit here. Talk to me.

16:40.040 --> 16:43.120
Have you heard anything
about the Tiemo lately?

16:44.320 --> 16:45.520
The Tiemo?

16:47.360 --> 16:49.560
Your Majesty, we're in Chang'an.

16:49.640 --> 16:51.560
How could the Tiemo get in?

16:52.200 --> 16:55.120
The ones who ambushed me
that night were Tiemo.

17:38.440 --> 17:42.360
I thought they were sent by Yan Fengshan.

17:44.560 --> 17:47.560
Huben guards kill with precision,

17:47.640 --> 17:51.280
nothing like the sweeping blade work
of open battle.

17:52.320 --> 17:54.320
I fought on the northern front for years.

17:54.920 --> 17:56.240
I know their ways well.

17:57.120 --> 18:00.720
Those attackers that night
were Tiemo without a doubt.

18:11.560 --> 18:12.560
Enough.

18:13.360 --> 18:15.960
I met someone in Cangshui River today,

18:16.040 --> 18:19.680
a young debt collector named Lu Xiaobing.

18:19.760 --> 18:20.800
Do you know of him?

18:22.880 --> 18:24.160
I do.

18:25.280 --> 18:27.600
Cruel, ruthless man.

18:27.680 --> 18:30.880
Your Majesty, a life like gold,

18:30.960 --> 18:33.720
must never deal with someone like him.

18:34.480 --> 18:35.600
Sir.

18:36.440 --> 18:37.880
You are a little late.

18:38.400 --> 18:41.520
In your name, I borrowed money from him.

18:42.360 --> 18:44.600
I expect he will come
looking for you soon.

18:46.720 --> 18:48.000
He will come here?

18:49.360 --> 18:50.200
Your Majesty,

18:50.280 --> 18:52.160
that exposes your location.
What should we do?

18:52.240 --> 18:54.960
-How do we handle this?
-Enough, sir.

18:55.040 --> 18:57.960
Do not worry. I have my own way.

18:58.040 --> 19:00.040
Several of my employers said the same.

19:00.120 --> 19:02.360
The salt-shop keeper borrowed gold.

19:02.880 --> 19:05.720
All added up, it's about four liang now.

19:06.400 --> 19:08.840
Old man, think carefully.

19:09.560 --> 19:11.440
Nine out, thirteen returned.

19:11.520 --> 19:13.200
If you can't repay,

19:14.120 --> 19:15.680
I'll burn your shop down.

19:17.760 --> 19:18.760
I will repay.

19:27.280 --> 19:31.360
And this one,
the worn-out looking fellow here.

19:31.440 --> 19:32.360
What's your story?

19:32.440 --> 19:33.680
I look worn-out?

19:34.200 --> 19:35.040
A little.

19:38.280 --> 19:40.000
I'm the one who borrowed the gold.

19:41.160 --> 19:42.000
Here.

19:42.960 --> 19:44.040
Borrowing so much money,

19:45.280 --> 19:46.720
planning a business?

19:46.800 --> 19:49.080
Or planning to flee with it?

19:49.920 --> 19:51.480
I want to pay you for your help.

19:52.720 --> 19:53.920
For you.

19:54.680 --> 19:55.880
Handle something for me.

20:06.560 --> 20:09.280
WARRANT

20:10.120 --> 20:11.400
Who is he?

20:12.160 --> 20:13.280
My brother.

20:13.920 --> 20:15.040
He's wanted.

20:15.640 --> 20:18.040
I believe he'll show up around here.

20:19.040 --> 20:21.600
I'm waiting to meet him again.

20:22.200 --> 20:23.920
Keep an eye out for me every day.

20:24.440 --> 20:28.360
If you hear anything, tell me at once,
quietly.

20:29.000 --> 20:30.240
Do it well,

20:30.960 --> 20:33.880
and this gold will be your reward.

20:37.160 --> 20:38.200
Let me get this straight.

20:38.280 --> 20:40.920
You borrowed money
from several of my employers,

20:42.000 --> 20:43.920
then you handed that money back to me.

20:44.960 --> 20:46.920
And when it's time to collect,

20:47.800 --> 20:49.440
I'll have to chase you for payment?

20:51.960 --> 20:54.480
We'll talk about repayment when it's due.

20:54.560 --> 20:57.680
But for now, I am your employer.

20:58.480 --> 21:00.200
Do the job well for me.

21:12.360 --> 21:13.840
-Xiaobing is back.
-Yes.

21:18.040 --> 21:19.080
Xiaoding.

21:21.960 --> 21:23.840
Xiaoding. You haven't eaten yet?

21:23.920 --> 21:26.040
-Waiting for you.
-Alright.

21:26.720 --> 21:27.800
Perfect timing then.

21:27.880 --> 21:29.160
We'll have something extra today.

21:30.160 --> 21:33.320
Listen,
I met a really strange fellow today.

21:33.920 --> 21:35.680
He gave me four liang of gold.

21:35.760 --> 21:36.960
That much?

21:37.920 --> 21:39.120
Yeah.

21:39.200 --> 21:41.520
Tell me, what brother
is worth four liang of gold?

21:41.600 --> 21:42.840
Besides,

21:43.480 --> 21:44.920
where would I find him a brother?

21:46.000 --> 21:49.520
Xiaobing. I think maybe it's time.

21:50.240 --> 21:52.960
-Time for what?
-Xiaobing, you're not young anymore.

21:53.040 --> 21:54.840
You should find a wife.

21:54.920 --> 21:58.080
But dragging me along
like baggage won't help.

21:58.160 --> 22:00.160
If you know some wealthy family,

22:00.240 --> 22:01.800
fix me up a bit,

22:01.880 --> 22:02.960
dress me like a boy,

22:03.040 --> 22:04.360
send me as their younger brother.

22:05.360 --> 22:07.400
You're dreaming way too big.

22:07.480 --> 22:08.840
I didn't raise you for nothing.

22:10.920 --> 22:13.800
Besides, if such luck really existed,

22:13.880 --> 22:15.400
a rich family seeking a younger brother,

22:15.920 --> 22:17.640
I should go first.

22:17.720 --> 22:19.120
Do you even know…?

22:19.640 --> 22:20.800
Eat.

22:21.880 --> 22:23.800
Come on, have more. More meat.

22:23.880 --> 22:25.240
This is good meat.

23:35.800 --> 23:36.720
Wuyang.

23:38.240 --> 23:39.600
If I come back alive,

23:40.880 --> 23:42.680
I'll keep looking after you.

23:46.960 --> 23:48.160
If I die,

23:50.120 --> 23:51.760
then let it be a death for the realm.

23:53.520 --> 23:55.200
At least I won't shame the Xiao family.

24:58.040 --> 24:59.400
Put this on later.

25:23.960 --> 25:25.520
When Xiao Wuyang dies,

25:25.600 --> 25:27.600
your friends will be safe.

25:50.520 --> 25:53.560
WONTONS

25:58.960 --> 26:02.360
IMPERIAL PHYSICIAN'S HALL

26:36.240 --> 26:37.160
Morning, Mr. Sha.

26:37.240 --> 26:38.160
Morning.

26:39.360 --> 26:40.520
Mr. Sha.

26:40.600 --> 26:42.040
Morning, Mr. Sha.

27:56.800 --> 27:57.640
Grand Preceptor.

27:57.720 --> 27:59.520
There is no Grand Preceptor anymore.

27:59.600 --> 28:02.480
Here in Chang'an,
there's only Cen Pickles.

28:36.880 --> 28:37.720
Your Majesty.

28:40.680 --> 28:42.320
Many years ago,

28:43.080 --> 28:45.760
Liu Ziwen and Grand Preceptor
Cen Weizong were both here.

28:45.840 --> 28:47.800
I heard them speak once

28:49.000 --> 28:51.160
of their vision for Cangshui River.

28:52.200 --> 28:53.640
Had I not seen it myself,

28:53.720 --> 28:56.840
I would never believe it's true.

28:57.680 --> 29:01.560
They said it still isn't fully built.

29:02.400 --> 29:05.800
But still, it has sheltered many people.

29:10.320 --> 29:14.440
I suppose everyone here
has some skills to survive.

29:15.040 --> 29:18.800
Out there, they could make a living too.

29:19.800 --> 29:21.320
I wonder

29:21.840 --> 29:24.640
why they choose to stay
in a place with no daylight.

29:28.280 --> 29:29.480
Your Majesty.

29:30.720 --> 29:33.640
People here are like duckweed.

29:34.560 --> 29:37.920
When they first arrive,
each has their own reason.

29:40.000 --> 29:42.240
Once duckweed takes root,

29:42.840 --> 29:44.640
it becomes home.

29:45.840 --> 29:47.040
Who

29:48.160 --> 29:51.280
would willingly leave their home again?

29:53.360 --> 29:57.920
The boatman in charge said
only his skiff can get outside.

29:58.920 --> 30:00.440
But that's not true.

30:01.040 --> 30:02.680
If one day

30:03.200 --> 30:05.320
Your Majesty decides to leave,

30:05.400 --> 30:08.040
you may find

30:08.120 --> 30:12.120
an unsealed tunnel on that cliffside.

30:14.680 --> 30:16.160
It leads out.

30:16.680 --> 30:18.280
Your Majesty,

30:19.120 --> 30:21.000
if that day comes,

30:22.800 --> 30:26.040
I will guide Your Majesty through.

30:26.840 --> 30:28.000
Me?

30:29.160 --> 30:31.120
I cannot leave yet.

30:31.200 --> 30:33.040
I must wait for Xie Huai'an.

30:39.000 --> 30:40.120
Your Majesty.

30:45.920 --> 30:48.560
You gave him four liang of gold

30:49.080 --> 30:53.400
just so he could
wander around here every day?

30:57.240 --> 30:59.840
I'll think of him
as my second pair of eyes.

31:00.840 --> 31:02.280
You saw it too, didn't you?

31:02.960 --> 31:04.720
He's wearing the shoes I gave him.

31:05.880 --> 31:08.960
Anyone observant will notice.

31:09.480 --> 31:13.400
Through him,
news will find its way back to me.

31:19.920 --> 31:22.120
All for Xie Huai'an.

31:23.520 --> 31:24.880
Yes.

31:25.520 --> 31:27.360
The Tiemo assassins,

31:27.440 --> 31:30.120
and Yan Fengshan's death,

31:30.640 --> 31:32.760
all happened that same night.

31:32.840 --> 31:35.800
Six days have passed since then.

31:35.880 --> 31:39.520
Xie Huai'an still hasn't appeared.

31:40.120 --> 31:42.200
He leaves no trace when he acts.

31:45.000 --> 31:46.080
If he is late,

31:46.720 --> 31:48.120
it means something went wrong.

31:50.520 --> 31:52.240
It seems even here,

31:53.920 --> 31:56.720
meeting him may not be easy.

31:58.840 --> 32:02.320
That child has suffered too much.

32:02.400 --> 32:03.680
Child?

32:05.120 --> 32:06.280
Sir.

32:07.760 --> 32:10.440
He even killed Yan Fengshan.

32:11.040 --> 32:12.800
This child may well be

32:12.880 --> 32:16.440
the most terrifying person in the empire.

32:18.600 --> 32:19.800
Your Majesty.

32:21.000 --> 32:22.840
When he was born,

32:22.920 --> 32:25.920
I was already working
in the Liu household.

32:27.640 --> 32:30.280
I watched with my own eyes

32:31.520 --> 32:33.520
as his white hair turned black again.

32:34.920 --> 32:36.680
In my eyes,

32:38.560 --> 32:40.760
he is still just a child.

32:42.920 --> 32:44.160
Do not worry.

32:46.680 --> 32:48.600
I will protect him well.

32:49.680 --> 32:52.040
You may live to see

32:52.120 --> 32:55.120
his hair turn from black to white.

33:23.800 --> 33:25.240
Xie Huai'an,

33:25.880 --> 33:28.000
you should be here by now.

33:32.720 --> 33:35.080
Have you ever thought about
how you might die?

33:36.480 --> 33:38.000
Mr. Huai'an looks gentle and refined,

33:38.080 --> 33:39.720
but when you speak,

33:39.800 --> 33:41.120
your words could chill one's bones.

33:43.800 --> 33:45.240
Gentle and refined, am I?

33:47.760 --> 33:49.440
You are smart enough.

33:49.520 --> 33:51.640
You should know how this ends for you.

33:53.040 --> 33:54.120
I do not.

33:54.960 --> 33:56.080
Then please, enlighten me.

33:57.120 --> 33:58.480
You will die

33:59.680 --> 34:01.080
long before you reach the summit.

34:03.160 --> 34:04.680
Why not at the summit?

34:07.640 --> 34:09.639
Had it been 30 years earlier,

34:10.159 --> 34:11.320
you might have stood a chance.

34:12.360 --> 34:14.639
Back then, the founding emperor
rose from nothing,

34:15.400 --> 34:16.560
and my father

34:17.320 --> 34:18.880
was still studying in the countryside.

34:19.679 --> 34:21.480
The Grand Preceptor first made a living

34:21.560 --> 34:22.960
selling pickled vegetables.

34:23.040 --> 34:26.159
But in the end,
they both reached the peak.

34:27.840 --> 34:28.719
Envy.

34:33.120 --> 34:34.400
No need to envy them,

34:35.520 --> 34:37.199
you simply chose the wrong road.

34:39.199 --> 34:40.120
Did I?

34:41.880 --> 34:44.000
Yan Fengshan, that great mountain,
has already fallen.

34:44.920 --> 34:46.480
Xiao Wenjing is already in our hands.

34:47.400 --> 34:49.360
Looking at the situation now,

34:49.440 --> 34:52.560
only the Tiemo people
still have a chance to reach the summit.

34:53.920 --> 34:54.960
As for me,

34:58.240 --> 35:00.040
I was born a Tiemo man.

35:08.640 --> 35:09.600
You are mistaken.

35:11.000 --> 35:13.200
Yan Fengshan never reached the peak,

35:14.520 --> 35:15.960
and the Tiemo never will.

36:40.520 --> 36:43.000
WARRANT

37:34.400 --> 37:37.320
Come look, come take a look.

37:56.240 --> 37:57.400
The wanted man is back.

38:00.600 --> 38:02.600
He must have seen the shoes you gave me,

38:02.680 --> 38:03.960
so he left the umbrella there on purpose.

38:07.080 --> 38:08.320
What is that supposed to mean?

38:11.280 --> 38:15.160
This umbrella once appeared
in a very large plot.

38:15.720 --> 38:16.720
Back then,

38:17.960 --> 38:19.880
he lost his only family.

38:22.920 --> 38:24.280
This is a warning to me

38:25.880 --> 38:27.440
that there is a trap ahead.

38:30.080 --> 38:32.360
So what does it have to do with you?

38:33.320 --> 38:34.440
Enough.

38:34.520 --> 38:36.000
You did what I asked. You may go.

38:36.720 --> 38:38.480
The four liang is yours.

38:38.560 --> 38:40.520
As for the rest,

38:40.600 --> 38:42.840
I will repay the lenders gradually.

38:43.440 --> 38:45.200
Four liang for running an errand?

38:45.280 --> 38:48.040
It was not just an errand, it was risky.

38:48.120 --> 38:50.320
Four liang, well deserved.

38:51.040 --> 38:52.520
I am not blind either.

38:53.040 --> 38:54.200
Your brother is no ordinary man.

38:54.960 --> 38:56.040
Someone is watching him.

38:56.640 --> 38:57.880
You're even more intriguing.

38:59.120 --> 39:00.000
You want someone dead.

39:04.480 --> 39:06.400
I, Lu Xiaobing,
collect debts in Cangshui River.

39:07.120 --> 39:08.520
Everyone knows I keep my word.

39:09.400 --> 39:11.440
Not a coin short, not a credit stolen.

39:12.320 --> 39:13.680
You paid me four liang,

39:14.240 --> 39:15.280
I can do a bit more for you.

39:15.360 --> 39:16.640
No need.

39:20.120 --> 39:21.760
I know you have family.

39:22.360 --> 39:24.400
When young men try to be fearless,

39:25.000 --> 39:26.440
they should think of home.

39:27.800 --> 39:29.040
Live well.

39:29.120 --> 39:30.320
Go on.

41:02.240 --> 41:04.080
The King of Tiemo is in the open now.

41:04.600 --> 41:06.720
We will face him this way.

41:35.640 --> 41:38.400
This blade of yours,
can it kill Xiao Wuyang?

41:38.480 --> 41:39.560
Of course not.

41:40.320 --> 41:42.320
Mr. Huai'an must know that already.

41:42.400 --> 41:44.080
No need to pry from me.

41:45.080 --> 41:46.480
As for others like me who hold blades,

41:47.160 --> 41:48.360
how many there are,

41:48.440 --> 41:49.760
or where they stand,

41:49.840 --> 41:51.280
I know nothing of it.

41:52.240 --> 41:55.080
So you do not know the final killing move.

41:55.160 --> 41:57.120
You are not at the core of this.

42:00.680 --> 42:02.320
Does Mr. Huai'an know it then?

42:03.400 --> 42:05.840
Think a little more,
and the answer comes naturally.

42:20.040 --> 42:22.880
Set head against head,
we can never match Xiao Wuyang.

42:27.080 --> 42:27.920
According to the plan,

42:28.520 --> 42:30.800
there is a teahouse by the mudflat ahead.

42:31.480 --> 42:33.760
That's the best spot
for us to wait for Xiao Wuyang.

42:38.400 --> 42:40.400
Even if shadow guards swarm the place,

42:40.480 --> 42:42.800
he will not win by ambush alone.

42:42.880 --> 42:45.800
As for my mentor,
he wants to take down the King of Death.

42:45.880 --> 42:47.640
I find myself truly curious

42:47.720 --> 42:49.440
about what move he plans to use.

43:16.160 --> 43:17.200
-Hurry.
-Here.

43:17.920 --> 43:18.960
Move.

45:21.360 --> 45:23.320
Strike the cicada first,

45:27.280 --> 45:29.360
‎then the oriole.
